  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  min-width: 44px;
  min-height: 44px;
}

/* The slotted icon span is display: block holding an inline svg, so its box
   is a line box (~23px for a 20px icon, with the svg sitting at the top of
   it). Before Shopify's account script defines the element that box is
   centred as-is; afterwards its shadow-DOM button lays the same span out
   differently - so the icon visibly dropped ~2px on every page load. A
   flex span is exactly the icon's size, which removes the line-box slack
